From e413cd815b1cb1f488bc98968d6d2a7e281b80e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "nipuna.dulara" <pererannd.21@uom.lk>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 13:06:20 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] nr: Final review-feedback fixes for the energy framework

Fix a codespell false positive in the gNB listener test, skip the
per-symbol energy stats work entirely when nothing is listening for it,
keep the DRX inactivity condition alive across a cycle boundary instead
of clearing it early, scale GetAverageRelativePower's active states the
same way GetStatePowerW does, remove
NrGnbPhyEnergyListener::GetLastUlSf, which was dead since it was added,
and dispose of the aggregator explicitly in its BasicEnergySource test
to break the Ptr cycle SetEnergySource()/AppendDeviceEnergyModel()
creates between them, which LeakSanitizer caught in CI.
